instruction:
Review this JavaScript code for security vulnerabilities:
```javascript
app.get("/api/orders/:id", (req, res) => {
  Order.findById(req.params.id).then(o => res.json(o));
});
```

output:
**Insecure Direct Object Reference (IDOR)** (CWE-639) [HIGH]

Filter by authenticated user ID to prevent IDOR.

**Vulnerable code:**
```javascript
app.get("/api/orders/:id", (req, res) => {
  Order.findById(req.params.id).then(o => res.json(o));
});
```

**Fixed code:**
```javascript
app.get("/api/orders/:id", auth, (req, res) => {
  Order.findOne({ _id: req.params.id, userId: req.user.id }).then(o => {
    if (!o) return res.status(404).end();
    res.json(o);
  });
});
```

